  - key: guide.build.title
    text: Build a Lumber Camp
  - key: guide.gather.title
    text: Gather your first wood
  - key: guide.store.title
    text: Build a Warehouse
  - key: guide.craft.title
    text: Craft your first recipe
  - key: guide.defend.title
    text: Clear an alien wave
  - key: guide.travel.title
    text: Land on a new world
  - key: guide.build.help
    text: Open BUILD > GATHER and place a Lumber Camp on this resource-rich home
      world.
  - key: guide.gather.help
    text: Tap the Lumber Camp and complete its wood mini-game. Better runs fill your
      pack faster.
  - key: guide.store.help
    text: Your backpack is small by design. Store extra resources in a Warehouse
      before expanding your haul.
  - key: guide.craft.help
    text: Build a Refinery, tap it, and craft a recipe from gathered materials. Each
      recipe is recorded in the Atlas.
  - key: guide.defend.help
    text: Build an Alarm if needed, tap it, and call a wave when you are ready. Defend
      your base; planets cannot be attacked.
