    text: Fuel Depot stores ship-fuel resources only. Its upgraded racks hold larger
      fuel stacks; reserves stay on this planet and never pay travel costs.
  - key: storage.help.harvester
    text: This hopper stores the Auto-Harvester's offline output. A local Cargo Depot
      connects its materials to this planet's shared build and craft pool.
  - key: storage.help.cargo
    text: This shared buffer joins operational Warehouses and Auto-Harvester hoppers
      on this planet. Build and craft costs draw from the pool automatically; travel
      still uses your backpack.
  - key: storage.help.connected
    text: Connected to this planet's Cargo Depot. Build and craft costs can draw
      from this storage automatically.
