  - key: content.obstacle.boulder.name
    text: Boulder
  - key: content.obstacle.boulder.description
    text: A weathered lump of rock sits where a pad should be. Break it up with picks
      and haul the pieces away.
  - key: content.obstacle.dead_tree.name
    text: Dead Tree
  - key: content.obstacle.dead_tree.description
    text: The trunk is long dead and the roots still grip the pad. Fell it, split
      it, and the wood is yours.
  - key: content.obstacle.wreckage.name
    text: Wreckage
  - key: content.obstacle.wreckage.description
    text: Someone else's landing ended here. Cut the hull apart for scrap before
      it blocks anything else.
  - key: content.obstacle.fungal_growth.name
    text: Fungal Growth
  - key: content.obstacle.fungal_growth.description
    text: A shelf of spore-heavy fungus has taken the pad. Burn it back and collect
      what the rot left behind.
  - key: content.obstacle.ice_spire.name
    text: Ice Spire
  - key: content.obstacle.ice_spire.description
    text: A spear of old ice has grown through the pad. Melt it carefully; the water
      is worth keeping.
  - key: content.obstacle.crystal_cluster.name
    text: Crystal Cluster
  - key: content.obstacle.crystal_cluster.description
    text: Raw crystal has burst through the ground. Cut it free before the whole
      pad starts to hum.
  - key: content.obstacle.magma_crust.name
    text: Magma Crust
  - key: content.obstacle.magma_crust.description
    text: A plate of cooled magma has fused over the pad, still ticking as it shrinks.
      Break the crust and clear the slag.
  - key: content.obstacle.void_scar.name
    text: Void Scar
  - key: content.obstacle.void_scar.description
    text: Space itself is torn here. Seal the scar with shielding alloy before it
      spreads under the next pad.
