  - key: content.objective.first_structure.title
    text: Make landfall yours
  - key: content.objective.first_structure.description
    text: Complete your first structure. Construction must finish before it counts.
  - key: content.objective.first_harvest.title
    text: First haul
  - key: content.objective.first_harvest.description
    text: Complete and collect a harvest run. Abandoned runs do not count.
  - key: content.objective.first_warehouse.title
    text: Room to grow
  - key: content.objective.first_warehouse.description
    text: Complete a Warehouse to store resources beyond your backpack.
  - key: content.objective.first_fuel.title
    text: Fuel the frontier
  - key: content.objective.first_fuel.description
    text: Craft fuel at a processing station. Found or starting fuel does not count.
